{"id":"n15770-1-9","stage":3,"title":"개별 · 个别","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15770-1-9-1","ko":"보고서는 이 주제로만 써야 하나요?","zh":"报告必须围绕这个主题来写吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보고서는","meaning":"报告书","explanation":"보고서：报告书；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"보고서","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59656","senseId":"1","lemma":"보고서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보고서는","audio":"/audio/54c0f25affd77afb87b5.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"주제로만","meaning":"主题","explanation":"주제：主题；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"주제","audio":"/audio/09053ac2411bc4cdd44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91771","senseId":"1","lemma":"주제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주제로만","audio":"/audio/e981231b7f8a5d134dbe.mp3"}},{"text":"써야","meaning":"写","explanation":"쓰다：写；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"써야","audio":"/audio/3eeba0baa1ae7cce1a5b.mp3"}},{"text":"하나요?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나요","audio":"/audio/208badeaa54755540b4c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"01a64adf7f150065","term":"보고서","zh":"报告书","audio":"/audio/01a64adf7f1500650cfd.mp3","entryId":"59656","definition":"告知研究、调查内容或结果的文件或文章。","pronunciation":["보ː고서"]}